RootRegistry::installRoot (genesis)
├── given a fresh registry
│   └── when a scheme is bootstrapped
│       ├── it should mark the scheme installed
│       ├── it should list the scheme in rootValidators
│       ├── it should mark the scheme active immediately (installed == active)
│       ├── it should initialize the scheme's credential (signerOf set)
│       ├── it should emit RootValidatorInstalled
│       └── it should authorize a signature from the bootstrapped signer at once
└── given a scheme already installed
    └── when the same scheme is bootstrapped again
        └── it should revert with RootAlreadyInstalled
